Test rg35 (XFAIL): a table that runs one word past the bank must still fail
// The companion to rg35_bank_ceiling. That test proves a block may END on
// 07777; this one proves the check was not simply removed. The table starts
// at 07770 and asks for 011 words, so its last word would be 010000.
100/
beg,    hlt
07770/
        table 011, 0123
stop
